  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">It contributes to Oxfam&apos;s broader decolonization mission and agenda by supporting the transition of Oxfam in Indonesia through the affiliation process. This includes ensuring that the country office exits in a way that is accountable, transparent, and aligned with Oxfam&apos;s values of shifting power and localization.</narrative>
  </description>
